          <a href="https://www.biorxiv.org/content/10.1101/2020.07.12.199000v1">https://www.biorxiv.org/content/10.1101/2020.07.12.199000v1</a>

          <br><br>
          Gene tagging with engineered Ds elements in maize. Li, Y., G. Segal, Q. Wang, 
          and H. K. Dooner. 2013 Methods in Molecular Biology: Plant Transposable 
          Elements, 1057: 83-99. T. Peterson, ed. Springer Science & Business Media, NY.
          <a href="https://doi.org/10.1007/978-1-62703-568-2_6">https://doi.org/10.1007/978-1-62703-568-2_6</a>
          <br><a href=" http://www.acdsinsertions.org/assets/filesdb/Gene%20tagging%20with%20engineered%20Ds%20elements%20in%20maize.pdf">Download pdf file</a>
        </p>
        <br>
